  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Efficient Water Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DescriptionThe Overall Objective of the Action is to improve irrigation water management and energy consumption to contribute to the enabling environment for institutions and business development in agriculture.Specific Objectives of this action are: S.O.1. To support selected energy-saving infrastructures investment in water supply for irrigation systems; S.O.2. To support the establishment of public incentives for private investments in new technologies and methods for on-farm irrigation; S.O.3. To provide Capacity building to support irrigation water demand management, improving effectiveness and operational efficiency and implementing nature-based solutions and reforestation for sustainable development particularly in managing water resources.</narrative>
  </description>
